PRO-FORMA FIRST BOARD RESOLUTION

RESOLVED that the initial capital contribution of CAD 1.00 be subscribed by the General Partner as per the Limited Partnership Agreement dated [Date];

RESOLVED that the registered office of the Limited Partnership be established at [Insert Full Address], Alberta, Canada;

RESOLVED that [Insert Name of General Partner], [Insert Title], be appointed as the General Partner with full authority to manage the affairs of the Limited Partnership, including the brokerage of bulk agricultural commodities such as soybeans and yellow corn;

RESOLVED that the Partnership Agreement be adopted as the governing instrument of the Limited Partnership;

RESOLVED FURTHER that the General Partner is authorized to execute all statutory filings with the Alberta Corporate Registry, including the Certificate of Limited Partnership, and to comply with all applicable federal and provincial laws and regulations.

This resolution is passed by the General Partner on [Date].
